<title>UK: Chrysler sets $200 mln three-year bond, 25 bp over.</title>
<headline>Chrysler sets $200 mln three-year bond, 25 bp over.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BNP Capital Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHRYSLER FINANCIAL CORP</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     **	  MATURITY    26.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    26.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+25 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.375 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 15.MAY.00 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
